{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：S10、S11停留时间较短，Y仍安排了多条较长的感受句，小字号感受文字容易来不及扫完；这两段X的短词更便于快速掠读。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y用加亮短语突出每段叙事的关键转折，感受又按照音乐出现的时序补充具体的声音、动作和身体反应，观众更容易边听边抓住重点。尤其是人物一边怀念、一边抗拒，一边想回去、一边害怕重蹈覆辙的矛盾，Y把其中的因果和情绪变化交代得更清楚。X的短词虽然便于单独掠读，但像S03、S06这样的词群容易变成情绪清单，缺少主次和相互关系；Y整体更细腻，也更容易让人感到十三段始终在讲同一个人的内心变化。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "43f4c418-8282-4dd2-8842-fa4547d9f022", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T031058072057Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.265, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:11:43.346407+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "864cf5f4e4c9333f3e98226037d5f093b7dfaa92758c66f4e3af9ead6cd11855", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6